(3. Costs and Results) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(The total installed cost of the pilot was 3.1 million US dollars, of which 1.3 million) Tj
T*
(was covered by a regional clean-energy grant. The remaining 1.8 million came from the) Tj
T*
(university capital budget.) Tj
T*
(During the twelve-month pilot, electricity bills for the three connected buildings fell) Tj
T*
(by 18 percent compared with the previous year, after adjusting for weather. The) Tj
T*
(university estimates a simple payback period of about 9 years for its share of the) Tj
T*
(investment.) Tj
T*
(Reliability results were also positive. The regional grid had four outages during the) Tj
T*
(pilot, the longest lasting 3 hours and 40 minutes. In every case the microgrid switched) Tj
T*
(to island mode and kept the Library Annex and Student Services Center powered without) Tj
T*
(interruption.) Tj
T*
(Students used operating data from the microgrid in two courses, Power Systems Analysis) Tj
T*
(and Energy Data Science.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
