(4. Risks, Limitations, and Next Steps) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(The pilot identified three main risks. Inverter firmware updates caused two short) Tj
T*
(unplanned shutdowns in the first quarter, which led the team to schedule updates only) Tj
T*
(during weekend maintenance windows. Snow cover reduced solar output by more than half on) Tj
T*
(several winter days. Finally, the evaluation covered only one year, so long-term battery) Tj
T*
(degradation is still uncertain.) Tj
T*
(The Facilities Office recommends expanding the microgrid to the Sports Center and the) Tj
T*
(Chemistry Building in 2026, subject to funding approval. It also recommends installing a) Tj
T*
(weather-based forecasting tool to plan battery charging ahead of cloudy days.) Tj
T*
(This report does not include an environmental life-cycle assessment of the batteries,) Tj
T*
(and it does not compare the pilot against buying renewable energy certificates.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
